WEBVTT

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:28.170
<b>Saeki</b>

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:37.430
<b>Saeki</b>

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:43.310
<b>Saeki</b>

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:05.130
<i>Stupid! Stop it!</i>

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:07.120
<i>What am I thinking?</i>

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:43.000
<i>Hey...</i>

00:01:45.740 --> 00:01:46.800
<i>Wait.</i>

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:54.920
<i>I said to wait...</i>

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:57.020
<i>Stop it.</i>

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:16.940
<b>Saeki</b>

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:31.790
<i>It smells like shampoo...</i>

00:02:56.110 --> 00:03:08.830
<b>Flowers of Evil</b>

00:02:56.110 --> 00:03:08.830
<b>Episode 2 of 13</b>

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:53.000
<i>I want to go far away...</i>

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:54.750
<i>Somewhere very far away.</i>

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:56.730
Take me

00:03:56.730 --> 00:03:58.500
beyond those mountains.

00:03:58.810 --> 00:04:02.220
And you will let me take 
something dear to you.

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:34.030
Welcome home.

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:36.580
Why are you covered in sweat, Takao?

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:38.090
Are you not feeling well?

00:04:38.550 --> 00:04:39.460
I'm okay...

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:41.800
Takao!

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:42.520
What is it?

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:44.300
Have you cleaned your room yet?

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:46.700
I told you yesterday—

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:46.700
O-Okay! Okay...

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:48.510
Just leave me alone for a bit!

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:52.220
Honestly...

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:54.890
He's as bad as his father, 
with those books everywhere.

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:31.810
<i>Flowers of Evil.</i>

00:05:33.150 --> 00:05:34.350
<i>No kidding...</i>

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:06.390
<i>Saeki-san is absent today?</i>

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:12.280
Yo, Kasuga...

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:13.500
Hey, did you watch last night—

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:14.330
Shut up!

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:15.950
Don't talk to me right now!

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:17.560
Huh?

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:19.370
What's with you?

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:23.240
<i>If she's absent,</i>

00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:26.160
<i>I can return it today before anyone notices.</i>

00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:29.420
Okay, take your seats.

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:35.160
Class monitor!

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:36.240
Stand.

00:06:37.690 --> 00:06:38.760
Bow.

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:40.460
Be seated.

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:46.280
Okay, I have something to discuss with you all.

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:47.250
Pay attention.

00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:50.470
When Saeki arrived today, 
her gym uniform was missing.

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:55.270
All right, keep it down...

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:58.430
It sounds as though her uniform 
was stolen from her gym bag.

00:06:58.430 --> 00:07:00.520
Does anyone know anything?

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.510
I can't believe it.

00:07:02.510 --> 00:07:04.370
I feel so bad for her.

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:05.150
I know.

00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:12.360
Sounds like what a pervert would do!

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:17.060
If anyone knows anything, come and see me.

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:19.240
Then let's get homeroom started.

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:41.360
<i>I want to go far away...</i>

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:43.770
<i>Somewhere very far away.</i>

00:07:45.870 --> 00:07:48.610
<i>I am a criminal.</i>

00:07:49.890 --> 00:07:50.980
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:53.460
<i>Saeki-san, I'm sorry.</i>

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:59.060
<i>I'll spend the rest of my life 
atoning for my crime.</i>

00:07:59.990 --> 00:08:02.170
<i>Even when I'm an old man,</i>

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:04.170
<i>I'll still be making up for this.</i>

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:09.860
<i>But there's nowhere to escape...</i>

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:11.920
<i>Not in this town,</i>

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:13.660
<i>not for me.</i>

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:17.490
<i>The town is surrounded by mountains.</i>

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:20.270
<i>There's nowhere for me to run.</i>

00:08:21.010 --> 00:08:24.900
<i>How many people in this town 
understand Baudelaire?</i>

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:28.780
<i>Why is all the iron here rusted?</i>

00:09:07.220 --> 00:09:10.520
Kasuga-kun, what are you doing?

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:13.870
Uh, I was just going to the bookstore.

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:14.550
Bye.

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:15.280
Say...

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:19.100
Kasuga-kun, you're always busy reading.

00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:20.120
Why?

00:09:25.320 --> 00:09:27.290
And it's always weird books,

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:29.440
the kind that look really obscure.

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:31.340
Are they that interesting?

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:37.590
How do you know this?

00:09:39.110 --> 00:09:40.390
Because I sit behind you.

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:45.810
Well, I don't know about "interesting,"

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:49.900
but books have changed my world.

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:52.270
Normal people wouldn't understand...

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:53.970
Eh... Eh?

00:09:53.970 --> 00:09:55.520
Wait, what're you doing?

00:09:55.520 --> 00:09:56.320
Take me

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:58.820
beyond those mountains.

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:00.950
Huh? Wh-Why?

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:03.660
Why? Because I want to go there.

00:10:04.090 --> 00:10:05.520
I don't understand.

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:07.000
The book I ordered just arrived.

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:09.960
I have to pick it up at the bookstore...

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:17.890
Kasuga-kun...

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:20.730
You know what?

00:10:24.050 --> 00:10:25.910
I saw you...

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:29.500
When you stole Saeki-san's uniform.

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:36.450
If you don't want me to tell everyone, 
then start pedaling.

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:47.840
Come on.

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:04.320
He ran away.

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:11.930
<i>What do you mean, "the mood today"?</i>

00:11:11.930 --> 00:11:13.530
<i>Ieharu, isn't it obvious?</i>

00:11:13.530 --> 00:11:15.440
<i>Everyone else knew!</i>

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:16.720
<i>You're an idiot!</i>

00:11:21.090 --> 00:11:23.450
What's wrong? Do you feel sick?

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:24.950
No.

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:26.800
Oh, right...

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:29.990
Did you get that new book, the one you ordered?

00:11:29.990 --> 00:11:31.930
I've been wanting to read it.

00:11:31.930 --> 00:11:33.040
Let me take a look.

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:37.090
I... I didn't buy it yet.

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:38.170
Takao?

00:11:38.890 --> 00:11:41.390
Where's your bike? I don't see it.

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:46.630
I left it at the bookstore...

00:11:46.630 --> 00:11:47.580
Why?

00:11:47.580 --> 00:11:50.060
Oh, so you did go to the bookstore?

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:54.490
I'm done!

00:11:55.050 --> 00:11:55.870
Takao?

00:11:55.870 --> 00:11:57.360
Now, now, dear...

00:11:57.360 --> 00:12:00.070
Takao's getting to be that age. 
He has a lot to deal with.

00:12:13.340 --> 00:12:15.510
<i>It's over...</i>

00:12:16.070 --> 00:12:17.960
<i>I've fallen.</i>

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:22.300
<i>Nakamura-san is going to tell everyone.</i>

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:24.060
<i>I'm sure she will.</i>

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:27.410
<i>And who knows what else she might do?</i>

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:30.680
<i>Why?</i>

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:32.130
<i>She's completely mistaken...</i>

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:34.250
<i>I didn't steal it.</i>

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:37.730
<i>I got lost in the moment, 
and brought it home.</i>

00:12:38.030 --> 00:12:39.390
Seriously, Kasuga?

00:12:39.390 --> 00:12:40.390
That's sick...

00:12:40.390 --> 00:12:40.990
Perv!

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:42.100
Are you insane?

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:42.400
Sad.

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:42.710
What?

00:12:42.710 --> 00:12:43.400
The nerve...

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:44.130
Apologize!

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:44.800
Go to hell!

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:46.080
Don't show your face around here.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:45.790
Thief!

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:47.540
A sad excuse for a man...

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:47.540
Pathetic.

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:48.490
I'm disappointed...

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:50.780
What are we supposed to tell the neighbors?

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:53.460
Die.

00:12:57.440 --> 00:12:58.890
...myself in.

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:01.420
I'll turn myself in.

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:06.050
Before Nakamura-san has 
a chance to tell everyone,

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:08.820
I'll apologize in person.

00:13:09.710 --> 00:13:12.940
Tomorrow, I'll return

00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:15.420
this uniform to Saeki-san,

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:19.040
and tell her that I just made a mistake...

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:25.240
<i>"I know that suffering is the sole nobility</i>

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:30.640
<i>Which earth and hell shall never mar,</i>

00:13:31.340 --> 00:13:35.000
<i>And that to weave my mystic crown,</i>

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:39.180
<i>You must tax every age and every universe."</i>

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:53.730
<i>"For that crown will be made 
of nothing but pure light</i>

00:13:53.730 --> 00:13:56.520
<i>Drawn from the holy source of primal rays,</i>

00:13:57.560 --> 00:14:02.880
<i>Whereof our mortal eyes, 
in their fullest brightness,</i>

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:06.530
<i>Are no more than tarnished, mournful mirrors!"</i>

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:29.300
I got myself a boyfriend yesterday.

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:30.430
Eh? No way!

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:31.410
Yes way!

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:36.020
Got a big one.

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:40.100
'Sup?

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:46.150
<i>Maybe...</i>

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:51.320
<i>Maybe</i>

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:55.090
<i>if I sincerely apologize, she'll understand.</i>

00:14:56.130 --> 00:14:58.560
<i>And see that I'm not a pervert.</i>

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:10.840
Okay, take your seats.

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:22.760
Well, that's it for the announcements...

00:15:22.760 --> 00:15:24.860
Anyone else have anything?

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:46.880
<b>Kasuga</b>

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:48.080
Guess not.

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:49.710
Homeroom's over, then.

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:08.180
2.25 meters!

00:16:08.510 --> 00:16:09.400
All right, next.

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:11.860
Nanako, where'd you get the uniform?

00:16:12.190 --> 00:16:13.950
I ended up buying a new one.

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:17.090
Oh, that thief is awful.

00:16:17.980 --> 00:16:21.580
Hey, Kasuga, don't you think you're 
staring at Saeki too much?

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:23.180
I-I'm not staring.

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:30.690
Well, Saeki-san sure is cute.

00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:32.200
As cute as an idol.

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:34.700
I can see why you'd have a crush on her.

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:36.140
It's not like that!

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:42.170
But when you think of some 
freak stealing her uniform,

00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:47.010
sniffing it, using it for various sexual purposes...

00:16:47.010 --> 00:16:50.440
Then there's something erotic about her body.

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:51.360
Stop it, idiot!

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:54.900
Hey, so who do you think it was?

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:57.820
It'd be gross if they were from our class!

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:03.860
I guess...

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:09.090
I have no issue with someone fantasizing 
about her, but this is a different story.

00:17:09.410 --> 00:17:11.300
It's a criminal act!

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:13.950
That's really messed up.

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:21.360
<i>It's over...</i>

00:17:22.130 --> 00:17:24.930
<i>I can't do this...</i>

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:29.100
<i>I can't turn myself in.</i>

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:36.910
<b>Flowers of Evil 
Baudelaire</b>

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:31.880
<i>Baudelaire,</i>

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:36.250
<i>I never realized the path of evil
would be so difficult.</i>

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:39.670
<i>But if I don't turn myself in,</i>

00:17:40.510 --> 00:17:45.100
<i>Nakamura-san will tell everyone, 
and that'll be even worse.</i>

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:52.080
<i>Why must I suffer like this?</i>

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:27.330
<b>After school, go to the library. 
Don't run away this time.</b>

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:55.090
<i>Stay calm...</i>

00:18:55.480 --> 00:18:56.970
<i>Stay calm now.</i>

00:19:07.770 --> 00:19:10.500
Uh... What is it?

00:19:12.980 --> 00:19:15.170
Why did you run away yesterday?

00:19:15.870 --> 00:19:17.910
Well, that's because

00:19:17.910 --> 00:19:18.880
you have it wrong!

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:23.470
Does that mean I can tell 
everyone that you stole it?

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:25.450
I didn't... You have the wrong idea!

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:27.560
Coward. Scumbag.

00:19:30.910 --> 00:19:32.820
Nakamura-san, please hear me out.

00:19:33.140 --> 00:19:34.820
I didn't steal it.

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:37.100
I took it home accidentally...

00:19:37.890 --> 00:19:40.140
I was planning to turn myself in today.

00:19:40.140 --> 00:19:43.530
I was going to return this to 
Saeki-san and apologize!

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:45.030
I see.

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:50.920
Kasuga-kun, I'm willing to let this go.

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:52.560
I won't tell anyone.

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:56.670
In return...

00:19:57.380 --> 00:19:59.460
You must agree to a contract with me.

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:02.470
C-Contract?

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:04.220
Yes,

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:06.930
I'll let you off the hook.

00:20:07.480 --> 00:20:11.350
And you will let me take 
something dear to you.

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:16.470
Hold on...

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:18.230
I don't understand what you mean.

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:20.260
E-Excuse me...

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:27.080
Kasuga-kun, what did you 
want to talk to me about?

00:20:27.400 --> 00:20:29.030
Saeki-san...

00:20:30.740 --> 00:20:34.870
I need to get to cram school, 
so I don't have much time...

00:20:35.440 --> 00:20:38.010
Sorry for calling you here 
when you're so busy.

00:20:38.010 --> 00:20:40.420
Kasuga-kun says he has something 
important to tell you.

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:41.970
Eh? What?

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:44.070
Go on.

00:20:50.920 --> 00:20:52.270
What is it?

00:21:11.770 --> 00:21:12.500
Sorry!

00:21:24.340 --> 00:21:25.980
Nice job, Kasuga-kun!

00:21:25.980 --> 00:21:28.220
Your face landed right where I'd planned.

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:33.180
So how do you feel?

00:21:33.180 --> 00:21:35.740
Write an essay about your 
current feelings by tomorrow.

00:21:36.310 --> 00:21:39.070
Remember, you have a contract with me.

00:21:39.070 --> 00:21:40.040
Right?

00:23:21.640 --> 00:23:24.600
Why did this happen?

00:23:22.890 --> 00:23:25.380
Did you write the essay? Go do it.

00:23:24.600 --> 00:23:26.250
It turns out that

00:23:25.380 --> 00:23:27.070
I should throw it away and end this!

00:23:26.250 --> 00:23:31.870
someone suspicious was near school that day.

00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:28.480
Kasuga, this is getting interesting.

00:23:28.480 --> 00:23:29.800
What do you want?

00:23:29.800 --> 00:23:31.870
Don't you have a crush on Saeki-san?

00:23:31.870 --> 00:23:33.700
Pervert.

00:23:31.870 --> 00:23:33.700
This is how Nakamura-san smells...

00:23:34.270 --> 00:23:35.550
Shut up, shit-face.

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:40.890
<b>Watch the next episode, shit-bag. 
Oshimi Shuuzou</b>
